<h2>Free and Easy to Use</h2>

<p>
Our tools are designed with simplicity in mind. Most tools work directly
in your web browser and are designed to work on both mobile phones and
desktop computers.
</p>

<h2>Privacy and Security</h2>

<p>
We respect user privacy and aim to provide tools that minimize unnecessary
data collection. Where a tool can process information directly in the
browser, we aim to keep that processing on the user's device.
</p>

<p>
For more information, please read our
<a href="../privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
</p>

<h2>Our Future Plans</h2>

<p>
We plan to continue adding useful tools and improving the existing tools
based on user needs and feedback.
</p>

